WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.800
Luke dashes after the prerequisite OD-Knuckle/heavy-Uppercut juggle.

2
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:01.100
Ryu attempts a throw as Luke backs away.

3
00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:01.650
Standing heavy punch punishes the missed throw.

4
00:00:01.650 --> 00:00:02.600
Perfect light Flash Knuckle launches Ryu.

5
00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:04.100
Light Sand Blast continues the juggle as Ryu reaches the corner.

6
00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:06.550
Light Rising Uppercut finishes the juggle.
